<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #222; line-height: 1.6;">

<p>{{greeting}}</p>

<p>I hope this follow-up finds you well. I had previously written to you regarding internship opportunities at {{company}} in {{internship_interest}}.</p>

<p>I remain very enthusiastic about the possibility of contributing to {{company}}&rsquo;s team. If there have been any updates on internship openings or the application process, I would be grateful to know.</p>

<p>My resume is attached for your convenience. Please feel free to reach out if you need any additional information.</p>

<p>Thank you again for your time.</p>

<p>
Warm regards,<br>
<strong>{{sender_name}}</strong><br>
{% if phone %}📞 {{phone}}<br>{% endif %}
{% if email %}✉️ {{email}}<br>{% endif %}
</p>

<hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin-top: 20px;">
<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #999;">If you'd prefer not to receive emails like this, just reply and I won't write again.</p>

</body>
</html>
